WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.530
Look at a sparkler.

2
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:04.510
Each spark is at a
very high temperature.

3
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.250
Now look at a warm bath.

4
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.090
It's at a lower temperature.

5
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.450
Here's the puzzle.

6
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.670
Which one holds more energy?

7
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.950
Surely the hotter one?

8
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.150
To find out, we'll zoom in on
what temperature really measures.

9
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.310
In this mission, you'll find
out how heat and temperature are

10
00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.330
different.

11
00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.850
You'll see why melting
ice stops getting warmer,

12
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:28.610
even while you heat it, and why
things expand when they warm up.

13
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:31.810
Your mission: decide
which holds more energy,

14
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:35.300
a spark or a warm
bath, and explain why.
